{"seq":31,"slug":"spectral-graph-theory","title":"谱图论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory","rating":{"composite":3.96,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"谱图论\">谱图论</h1><p>一张图可以用一个矩阵完整编码，而矩阵有特征值。谱图论问的就是这件事：当我们把图写成邻接矩阵或拉普拉斯矩阵，再去看它们的特征值与特征向量时，这些纯代数的数字能告诉我们什么样的图的几何与组合性质。答案出乎意料地丰富——一个矩阵的第二小特征值能判断图连不连通、能给出最优的图划分、能驱动 PageRank 的收敛速度、能让高维数据自动降到二维聚成簇。谱是图的&quot;指纹&quot;，而读懂指纹是这个 hub 的全部内容。</p>\n<p>本 hub 沿四条逐级递进的主线展开。第一条是「基础」：把图翻译成矩阵（邻接、度、关联、拉普拉斯），并说清为什么值得研究谱，最后系统建立拉普拉斯矩阵这一全书主角的性质。第二条是「特征值」：把单个特征值与图的性质一一对应起来——零特征值的重数数连通分量、第二小特征值（代数连通度）度量连通的&quot;牢固程度&quot;、Rayleigh 商给出一整套估界工具。第三条是「应用」：谱聚类、图划分与 Cheeger 不等式、谱嵌入，是前两条线在机器学习与算法中的直接兑现。第四条是「实践」：随机游走与 PageRank、扩展图、以及真正把谱算出来的数值方法，把理论落到能运行的代码上。</p>\n<p>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界要分清。隔壁的 <a href=\"../graph-theory/\">图论</a> 讲图的组合结构——遍历、最短路、匹配、着色、网络流——它不碰矩阵特征值；本 hub 恰恰从图论结束的地方接手，专攻&quot;图的代数谱&quot;这一个切面。<a href=\"../linear-algebra/\">线性代数</a> 提供特征值、特征向量、谱定理、SVD 等通用工具，是本 hub 的前置；本 hub 不重新教这些工具，只把它们用在图矩阵这一特定对象上。数据科学里的 <a href=\"../../data-science/network-graph-analysis/\">网络与图分析</a> 和系统思考里的 <a href=\"../../systems-thinking/network-science/\">网络科学</a> 关心真实网络的统计与可视化，本 hub 则为它们提供谱方法这一数学引擎。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径分两类读者。想理解原理的读者按 hub 顺序读：基础 → 特征值 → 应用 → 实践，每一章都建立在前一章之上，跳读会丢链条。带着具体任务来的工程师可以走捷径：要做聚类直接读 <a href=\"applications/spectral-clustering\">谱聚类</a>，但回头补 <a href=\"foundations/laplacian-basics\">拉普拉斯矩阵基础</a> 和 <a href=\"practice/spectral-computation\">谱计算与数值</a> 才能调对参数、跑得动大图。</p>\n<p>前置知识：线性代数中的特征值与特征向量、对称矩阵的谱定理（实特征值、正交特征向量）、Rayleigh 商；图论中的邻接关系、度、连通分量、割等基本概念。具备这些后，本 hub 的每一篇都能独立读懂，而连起来读会看到同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 如何在连通性、划分、混合时间、扩展性四个看似无关的问题里反复出现——这种统一性正是谱图论的魅力所在。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-matrices","title":"图的矩阵表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/foundations/graph-matrices"},{"seq":2,"slug":"why-spectra","title":"为何研究图的谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/foundations/why-spectra"},{"seq":3,"slug":"laplacian-basics","title":"拉普拉斯矩阵基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/foundations/laplacian-basics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"eigenvalues","title":"特征值","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/eigenvalues","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"connectivity-spectrum","title":"连通性与谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/eigenvalues/connectivity-spectrum"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algebraic-connectivity","title":"代数连通度 Fiedler","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/eigenvalues/algebraic-connectivity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-bounds","title":"谱的界与不等式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/eigenvalues/spectral-bounds"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spectral-clustering","title":"谱聚类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/applications/spectral-clustering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-partitioning","title":"图划分与 Cheeger","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/applications/graph-partitioning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-embedding","title":"谱嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/applications/spectral-embedding"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"random-walks-pagerank","title":"随机游走与 PageRank","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/practice/random-walks-pagerank"},{"seq":2,"slug":"expander-graphs","title":"扩展图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/practice/expander-graphs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-computation","title":"谱计算与数值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/practice/spectral-computation"}]}]}